1
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:26,860
Aiming at the sunset
floating over the Nakagawa,

2
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:34,000
I kick a pebble and my shoe flies off too,

3
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:42,340
right onto the head of the
carpenter who'd been saving up.

4
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:48,440
They laughed that I'm still just a kid.

5
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:55,280
Even if I spread my spirit elsewhere,
Katsushika is where I belong.

6
00:00:55,280 --> 00:01:02,540
With another yawn,
the unchanged streets feel strangely kind.

7
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:14,640
From the pointed hat's water
tower up to the great stone sky,

8
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:16,780
the sun goes down.

9
00:01:20,700 --> 00:01:25,260
Tomorrow, too, it'll all end just like this

10
00:01:25,260 --> 00:01:30,340
Katsushika, Shibamata,
even happiness is lost again.

11
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,860
Because I'm a fool who
only just realized it.

12
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:41,620
Nakagawa-kun grew up in the old downtown.

13
00:01:44,820 --> 00:01:45,600
Are you ready?

14
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:47,820
Yes, OK.

15
00:01:48,340 --> 00:01:49,160
Let's go.

16
00:01:52,160 --> 00:01:53,040
Do your best.

17
00:02:02,960 --> 00:02:05,660
Unbelievable, with a paper spoon like that!

18
00:02:05,660 --> 00:02:08,400
Tasty, isn't it?
As expected of the old town, so-cchi!

19
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:08,660
Tch!

20
00:02:10,900 --> 00:02:14,060
Hey…

21
00:02:15,720 --> 00:02:17,300
Excuse me, one more time!

22
00:02:17,500 --> 00:02:18,400
Here, 100 yen!

23
00:02:19,980 --> 00:02:22,860
Challenging me at goldfish scooping?
You're ten years too early!

24
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:26,680
Goldfish scooping takes
caution and boldness!

25
00:02:27,160 --> 00:02:30,980
Well, even after ten or twenty tries,
the secret of this art is…

26
00:02:30,980 --> 00:02:31,900
Big sis, that's amazing!

27
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:32,880
What?

28
00:02:35,300 --> 00:02:37,840
Once you get the knack, you can
scoop as many as you want, can't you!

29
00:02:38,400 --> 00:02:39,420
Kei-chan, you've got good instincts!

30
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:41,540
Mr. Nakagawa, bravo!

31
00:02:41,860 --> 00:02:42,640
Jodie?

32
00:02:43,380 --> 00:02:44,380
That's ridiculous!

33
00:02:44,580 --> 00:02:48,740
To master the secret I spent years
acquiring in just a few minutes!

34
00:02:50,280 --> 00:02:51,400
There you go, Jodie-san!

35
00:02:51,720 --> 00:02:53,420
Thank you, Mr. Nakagawa!

36
00:02:53,660 --> 00:02:54,920
Good for you, Jodie!

37
00:02:55,260 --> 00:02:56,120
So cute!

38
00:02:56,440 --> 00:02:58,700
Mr. Nakagawa,
you're the King of the Shitamachi!

39
00:02:59,160 --> 00:02:59,420
Right?

40
00:02:59,440 --> 00:03:01,920
King of the Shitamachi, indeed!
King of the Shitamachi, indeed!

41
00:03:02,040 --> 00:03:04,800
King of the Shitamachi!
King of the Shitamachi!

42
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:07,520
Calling me king is going too far,

43
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:12,060
Well, it's good the weather's clear,
isn't it?

44
00:03:12,060 --> 00:03:14,660
Last year a typhoon hit us head-on,
remember?

45
00:03:14,660 --> 00:03:16,860
Around here, even in Tokyo,

46
00:03:29,060 --> 00:03:30,900
What's wrong, Taimo-no-oyatsu-san?

47
00:03:31,820 --> 00:03:32,960
It's nothing, never mind.

48
00:03:37,380 --> 00:03:38,720
What a cute doll.

49
00:03:39,180 --> 00:03:40,760
Hey, where do they sell these?

50
00:03:40,760 --> 00:03:42,900
I want to buy one as
a souvenir to take home.

51
00:03:42,900 --> 00:03:44,300
The Jizo statue...

52
00:03:44,720 --> 00:03:47,060
They don't sell them at souvenir shops,
do they?

53
00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:48,820
Ryo-chan.

54
00:03:48,820 --> 00:03:53,080
Well, Nakagawa, the king of the old town,
probably knows more about it.

55
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:54,900
Why are you sulking?

56
00:03:55,640 --> 00:03:58,000
If they don't sell them,
then I'm taking this one home after all.

57
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:00,080
There are so many of them,
one won't hurt, right?

58
00:04:00,500 --> 00:04:01,820
No, you can't do that.

59
00:04:01,820 --> 00:04:03,940
You can't just take this without permission.

60
00:04:06,620 --> 00:04:08,180
It's small, but it's cute.

61
00:04:08,180 --> 00:04:10,020
Thank you, Mr. Nakagawa.

62
00:04:10,820 --> 00:04:13,820
Souvenir shops these days
carry all sorts of things,

63
00:04:13,820 --> 00:04:16,140
so I thought there might be one.

64
00:04:16,140 --> 00:04:17,360
As expected of Kei-chan.

65
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:20,000
As expected of the king of Shitamachi,
Mr. Nakagawa.

66
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,540
You've got me there.

67
00:04:23,440 --> 00:04:25,320
I love Japan's Shitamachi.

68
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:27,980
Where are we going next, Mr. Nakagawa?

69
00:04:28,580 --> 00:04:28,940
Well, let me think.

70
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:32,720
After the Shibamata Daisaku exhibition,
Asakusa's Kaminarimon

71
00:04:33,960 --> 00:04:37,760
Touring famous tourist spots
that everyone in Japan knows,

72
00:04:37,760 --> 00:04:40,400
you're playing the Shitamachi
expert after one visit?

73
00:04:41,380 --> 00:04:43,300
If you're going to
nitpick Kei-chan's guiding,

74
00:04:43,300 --> 00:04:44,840
then let Ryo-chan be the escort.

75
00:04:45,640 --> 00:04:48,360
Will Mr. Ryotsu be
showing us around this time?

76
00:04:49,300 --> 00:04:50,200
Fine by me.

77
00:04:50,540 --> 00:04:52,220
To truly savor Shitamachi,

78
00:04:52,220 --> 00:04:55,100
there's a place you absolutely must go,
no matter what.

79
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:56,720
That place is...

80
00:04:58,460 --> 00:04:59,100
Here it is.

81
00:05:00,140 --> 00:05:03,020
You can't talk about Shitamachi
without visiting the public bath.

82
00:05:03,760 --> 00:05:06,560
I've always wanted to
try a Japanese bathhouse.

83
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:11,820
Nakagawa, who grew up in New York, has probably
never been to a Shitamachi public bath, right?

84
00:05:13,620 --> 00:05:15,180
I've been once, before.

85
00:05:15,580 --> 00:05:18,260
Anyway, once you go in,
there's a problem right away.

86
00:05:19,140 --> 00:05:22,260
Lately, a lot of them have gone
to the counter-style system.

87
00:05:22,840 --> 00:05:27,440
You assumed Shitamachi bathhouses were stuck in the past and had no progress at all,
didn't you?

88
00:05:29,320 --> 00:05:31,980
Ryo-san? We don't open until three.

89
00:05:32,460 --> 00:05:33,640
It's only two o'clock!

90
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:36,100
The water's already hot, right?
Don't be so rigid about it!

91
00:05:36,520 --> 00:05:38,120
But we have to keep to the schedule.

92
00:05:38,700 --> 00:05:40,220
Senpai, let's come back later.

93
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:44,420
You... haven't we met somewhere?

94
00:05:45,460 --> 00:05:46,880
What's wrong, Ryo-chan?

95
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:49,820
Don't tell me the ladies are going in too?

96
00:05:50,220 --> 00:05:51,420
Yes!

97
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:53,980
I'm sorry, but

98
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:58,560
Well, if we went to the trouble of welcoming a foreign guest
and then looked down on them by keeping them out of the bath...

99
00:05:59,100 --> 00:06:00,020
it'd be a disgrace to Kame-no-yu!

100
00:06:00,420 --> 00:06:03,300
Come, come, the bath is all yours.
Please take your time and enjoy it.

101
00:06:03,480 --> 00:06:05,580
- Please!
- Thank you, mister.

102
00:06:06,700 --> 00:06:08,720
So this is the Shitamachi warmth

103
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:11,240
That's the old geezer's act of kindness.

104
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:14,360
Yeah!

105
00:06:14,480 --> 00:06:15,140
Woohoo!

106
00:06:18,340 --> 00:06:21,040
Woohoo! The first bath is the best!

107
00:06:21,500 --> 00:06:22,320
That's right.

108
00:06:26,180 --> 00:06:26,540
Yes.

109
00:06:26,860 --> 00:06:28,880
The whole Kame-no-yu is reserved for us?

110
00:06:30,420 --> 00:06:31,920
Apparently Jodie's coming too.

111
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:33,200
Wow, sounds like fun.

112
00:06:33,200 --> 00:06:34,520
Coming, coming right away!

113
00:06:35,040 --> 00:06:35,700
See ya.

114
00:06:40,940 --> 00:06:42,940
Still heavily armed, as always

115
00:06:42,940 --> 00:06:45,000
Doesn't it rust from being
dipped in the hot water?

116
00:06:45,540 --> 00:06:47,440
There are lots of guard jobs at hot springs,
after all.

117
00:06:48,260 --> 00:06:51,660
I use an all-stainless steel revolver that won't rust,
even in water.

118
00:06:54,860 --> 00:06:56,760
Ugh, it's just water droplets.

119
00:06:59,400 --> 00:07:02,920
Sorry, my body just reacts on instinct,
I can't help it.

120
00:07:07,100 --> 00:07:07,960
What is it, Nakagawa?

121
00:07:07,960 --> 00:07:10,660
Hey, you're wrapping a towel
around your waist and everything?

122
00:07:10,660 --> 00:07:11,520
Take it off, take it off!

123
00:07:11,520 --> 00:07:15,440
Even if you're my senior, I don't want
to be forced into how I take a bath.

124
00:07:17,540 --> 00:07:20,100
There were people like
that when I was a kid, too.

125
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:21,700
How did you deal with them?

126
00:07:22,260 --> 00:07:22,980
I'm watching.

127
00:07:31,100 --> 00:07:32,880
Stop it, senpai.

128
00:07:33,700 --> 00:07:35,500
The more you hide it,
the more people wonder about it.

129
00:07:35,500 --> 00:07:40,300
If you don't take it off, people will think
you've got something outrageous under there.

130
00:07:40,300 --> 00:07:42,240
That's not true at all.

131
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:44,960
Then go in and show us your dick properly.

132
00:07:44,960 --> 00:07:45,720
Exactly.

133
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:49,280
Walking in with your balls out is
the natural way for a man to do it.

134
00:07:50,400 --> 00:07:51,660
Dick?

135
00:07:51,760 --> 00:07:53,220
What an intense conversation.

136
00:07:53,220 --> 00:07:57,340
Only a crazy person would be
so fixated on one tiny towel.

137
00:07:57,340 --> 00:07:58,040
Senpai.

138
00:07:58,720 --> 00:08:01,120
A midday bath really feels good

139
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:05,000
Look, Honda, a Shitamachi kid,
doesn't hide a thing, does he?

140
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:06,040
What is it?

141
00:08:06,460 --> 00:08:09,620
Nakagawa looks down on petty commoners like us
,

142
00:08:09,620 --> 00:08:12,600
who were raised in Shitamachi, and refuses to
show his own dick, discriminating against us.

143
00:08:12,600 --> 00:08:13,960
That's cruel!

144
00:08:13,960 --> 00:08:15,400
N-no, that's not true!

145
00:08:15,400 --> 00:08:19,520
You pretend to be a Shitamachi guy, but deep
down you look down on Shitamachi, don't you?

146
00:08:19,520 --> 00:08:21,060
I'm telling you, that's not the case at all.

147
00:08:21,060 --> 00:08:23,120
Then do it like I do.

148
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:24,600
Drape the towel over your shoulder,

149
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:27,380
and walk in proudly,
showing everything up front like this.

150
00:08:27,380 --> 00:08:28,040
Yo!

151
00:08:29,520 --> 00:08:30,580
How's the cake

152
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:32,060
It's so-so.

153
00:08:32,060 --> 00:08:32,660
And then,

154
00:08:38,980 --> 00:08:42,640
if you do this,
I'll admit you're a Shitamachi kid.

155
00:08:42,640 --> 00:08:44,820
I was raised in New York.

156
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:48,000
So you've finally shown your true colors.

157
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:49,280
You fake Shitamachi king!

158
00:08:58,880 --> 00:08:59,780
No way!

159
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:07,832
If they're resisting this fiercely,

160
00:09:07,882 --> 00:09:10,160
it must be incredibly shaped.

161
00:09:11,520 --> 00:09:13,320
My imagination just keeps running wild.

162
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:17,080
What are you imagining!

163
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:21,240
Thanks for your hard work.

164
00:09:21,240 --> 00:09:22,220
Welcome!

165
00:09:22,220 --> 00:09:23,986
Tomiyama-san,

166
00:09:24,036 --> 00:09:26,660
how's it going?
How's your health been lately?

167
00:09:27,740 --> 00:09:30,280
Can't complain,
but I'm not doing bad either.

168
00:09:32,020 --> 00:09:35,080
Instructor Honda, I'm going for a shampoo.

169
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:35,960
Coming!

170
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:36,440
Here we go.

171
00:09:38,800 --> 00:09:39,600
Thanks.

172
00:09:40,220 --> 00:09:41,480
You're welcome.

173
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:44,380
What a groundbreaking idea, Honda.

174
00:09:45,500 --> 00:09:48,235
In a Shitamachi bathhouse,
it's an everyday occurrence,

175
00:09:48,285 --> 00:09:50,000
a perfectly ordinary sight.

176
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:52,440
What groundbreaking idea?

177
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:56,140
Brings back memories,
from when we were kids.

178
00:10:01,020 --> 00:10:04,800
As soon as school gets out,
they go to the bathhouse and play for hours!

179
00:10:04,800 --> 00:10:07,640
Momoko, wash yourself properly.

180
00:10:07,640 --> 00:10:08,280
Yes.

181
00:10:08,760 --> 00:10:11,680
Since we all live nearby,
we all go to the same bathhouse, right?

182
00:10:11,680 --> 00:10:16,640
Knowing my naked classmates were on the other
side of that wall made my heart pound strangely.

183
00:10:17,220 --> 00:10:19,980
It's a bittersweet memory
only Shitamachi can give you.

184
00:10:19,980 --> 00:10:23,300
Well, it's a world you wouldn't understand,
Nakagawa, having grown up in New York.

185
00:10:26,320 --> 00:10:29,040
Shitamachi kids really
have something to live for.

186
00:10:30,980 --> 00:10:31,280
Sorry to keep you waiting.

187
00:10:31,280 --> 00:10:33,220
Your towel...

188
00:10:34,380 --> 00:10:37,140
Shitamachi talk that has
nothing to do with Nakagawa.

189
00:10:37,140 --> 00:10:39,180
Please, don't go to any trouble.

190
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:41,840
Jodie's bust is big, isn't it?

191
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:42,760
Wow.

192
00:10:43,420 --> 00:10:45,720
No, Reiko's is bigger.

193
00:10:45,720 --> 00:10:46,900
My nose is bleeding.

194
00:10:48,060 --> 00:10:49,180
It's long, isn't it?

195
00:10:49,180 --> 00:10:50,580
But not that much.

196
00:10:50,580 --> 00:10:52,460
This is quite a conversation.

197
00:10:52,460 --> 00:10:56,140
After being told that much,
can a man just stay silent?

198
00:10:56,140 --> 00:10:57,360
